WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:34.458
One more word. Better search?

00:00:34.458 --> 00:01:08.863
Two records from the Evidence Lab

00:01:08.863 --> 00:01:37.552
All five required: both records fail

00:01:37.552 --> 00:02:07.644
Any match: the extra evidence stays

00:02:07.644 --> 00:02:36.791
Rare does not mean a good synonym

00:02:36.791 --> 00:03:09.847
Saturation cannot repair the concept

00:03:09.847 --> 00:03:46.000
Check the term, then check its job
